  "$id": "urn:ai-commerce:ClaimRightsReleaseReview:v1",
  "title": "ClaimRightsReleaseReview.v1",
  "description": "Deterministic, offline commercial placement review of declared claims and actual asset bytes. VERIFIED_EVIDENCE describes exact local evidence replay, never external truth, legal permission, platform approval, account eligibility or publication. Nonfactual declarations are outside factual claim review. Status evidence is a supplied, dated holder observation, not issuer authentication. Reading requires original inputs and full recomputation; a resealed digest alone is insufficient.",
